= Importing and Extending

Bring existing notes from other tools into InkyCap, customize how new notes are made, and benefit from the wider #link("https://typst.app/universe/")[Typst ecosystem].


== In this section

- #wikilink("2 - Importing Existing Notes"). How to bring Markdown and Obsidian-specific notes into InkyCap: importing a folder or vault, mapping YAML frontmatter to properties, and pasting Markdown into a Typst note.
- #wikilink("3 - Scaffolds, Templates, and Packages"). How to use InkyCap scaffolds, creation rules, and Typst templates and packages to give your notes reusable starting points and tap the Typst ecosystem for new functionality.
- #wikilink("4 - Extensions"). How to extend InkyCap today using the experimental Extensions tab and external tools, plus file-based declarative plugins and other extension surfaces.
